{"type":"message","message":{"id":"gen-1775350482-nC5bDxrD2DeiX9266XrI","role":"assistant","created":1775350497,"content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I can see the data. I need to find the Q4 (October, November, December) auction data for 2-year Treasury notes for the years:\n- Q4 1987 (Black Monday was in 1987, so this is the last quarter of 1987)\n- Q4 1988\n- Q4 1989\n- Q4 1990\n\nLet me find the exact \"tenders accepted\" amounts for each 2-year note auction in those quarters. The data shows:\n\nFor 1987 (in the 1988 bulletin which would contain late 1987 data):\n- Oct 21, 1987: $9,255 million accepted\n- Nov 18, 1987: $9,269 million accepted  \n- Dec 1987: Need to find this\n\nFor 1988 (in the 1989 bulletin):\n- Oct 26, 1988: $9,014 million accepted\n- Nov 22, 1988: $9,027 million accepted\n- Dec 1988: Need to find this\n\nFor 1989 (in the 1990 bulletin):\n- Oct 1989: Need to find this\n- Nov 1989: Need to find this  \n- Dec 1989: Need to find this\n\nFor 1990 (in the 1991 bulletin):\n- Oct 30, 1990: $12,107 million accepted\n- Nov 1990: Need to find this\n- Dec 1990: Need to find this\n\nLet me search more specifically for the December auction data and more details.\n","signature":""},{"type":"toolRequest","id":"call_bb6879de831960f8","toolCall":{"status":"success","value":{"name":"shell","arguments":{"command":"grep -A5 \"December.*2-Year\\|2-Year.*December\" /app/resources/*.txt | head -60"}}},"_meta":{"goose_extension":"developer"}}],"metadata":{"userVisible":true,"agentVisible":true}}}
